cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: 'downscaleMagpie: Downscaling of MAgPIE Outputs to 0.5 Degree'
version: 0.1.0.9001
date-released: '2026-10-16'
abstract: 'Prepares the outputs of a MAgPIE run for the model-agnostic downscaling
  kernels of luscale and writes the gridded results: readers of the gdx, the configuration
  and the 0.5 degree files of the output folder, the MAgPIE-specific products (land
  with sub-types and transitions by stage, peatland, land conservation, age classes,
  cropland split, biodiversity intactness) and a writer of the output files.'
authors:
